<title>SWEDEN: Stockholm bourse to lift NCC trade halt.</title>
<headline>Stockholm bourse to lift NCC trade halt.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Stockholm bourse said on Tuesday it will lift the trading suspension of construction companies NCC, Siab and Lundbergs at 1000 GMT.</p>
<p>NCC said earlier it will merge with Siab, whose main shareholder is Lundbergs. The companies were suspended on Monday.  </p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1017</p>
</text>
